# This repo tracks ONLY the readable/hand-written layer of the RE project: notes, tools, and
# decompiled GDScript. Everything heavy or regenerable (recovered assets, packs, build output, raw
# extractions, evidence JSON, logs) lives under work/ and stays untracked on purpose, so the repo
# stays small enough for GitHub. Regenerate the big trees with the commands in work/README.md.
#
# Pattern order matters: default-deny at the top, then explicit re-inclusions.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/ARCHITECTURE_PLAN_portable-rea-re-env.md
!/gemini_rea_conv.json_2026-11-17.md
!/play.sh

!/work/
/work/*
!/work/README.md

!/work/50_roundtrip/
/work/50_roundtrip/*
!/work/50_roundtrip/REPORT.md

!/work/60_patches/
/work/60_patches/*
!/work/60_patches/PATCH_SYSTEM.md
!/work/60_patches/effective_0.2.3/
# build/ and out/ under 60_patches are generated -> ignored

# never track these, wherever they appear
*.gdc
*.gdc.uid
*.gd.uid
*.pck
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.tmp
*.zip
.godot/
godot*/
__pycache__/
export_credentials.cfg
eos/credentials.cfg
gdre_export.log
